  "description": {
   "en": "*An ensemble drama about Hanayama Ame (30); by the winner of the 26th Osamu Tezuka Cultural Prize [Short Story Award]*\n\nWhat do we know about Ame…?\nThat she suddenly moved to a small, old, one-story house in the suburbs. That she keeps cooking the same dishes when she starts to get picky. And that Ame never falls in love. She's a little different from everyone else, but they're just strange as her."
  },
